    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In cold weather, we often miss the warmth of summer. If only we could "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "store",
            "ref": "v-store"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the summer heat for the cold winter months! Believe it or not, a new "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "technology",
            "ref": "v-technology"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " has made this idea "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "—by using a lot of sand."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Have you ever been to a beach on a hot day? If so, then you’ll know how sand can feel like it’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " your feet. In fact, sand can be heated to very high temperatures. It is also very good at "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that heat. For this reason, some Finnish engineers have "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a seven-metre-tall sand battery. This large battery tower is "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with about 100 tons of sand. The engineers used some solar panels to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "electricity",
            "ref": "v-electricity"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The sand can be heated by electricity to about 500 degrees "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Celsius",
            "zh": "摄氏度"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and stay hot for several months. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", the energy stored in summer can be used in winter. The heat can be used to warm homes, offices and "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " local swimming pools."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This green energy technology is still being "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in Finland. The engineers want to spread it to the world as soon as possible. They hope this technology can help "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the use of "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fossil fuels",
            "ref": "v-fossil-fuel"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
